

Notes for NXP FLEXSPI soc-specific(soc) options:
soc options: all options are separated by colons

'base'                      : flexspi controller base address
'irq'                       : flexspi controller IRQ number
'abma_base'                 : flexspi controller ABMA mapping base address
'octcomb_en'=[0|1]          : enalbe Octal combination mode (default: disable)
'rxclksrc'                  : Sample Clock source selection for Flash Reading(default: 0). Note: check RXCLKSRC field of MCR0 register for details.


Examples of soc options:
For imx8qm-mek board:
%C -s verbose=1,soc=base=0x5D120000:irq=124:abma_base=0x08000000